*Mexico advanced to play [[United States men's national soccer team|United States]] (runner-up of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group D|Group D]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#Mexico vs United States|round of 16]].
*Italy advanced to play [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]] (winner of [[2002 FIFA World Cup Group D|Group D]]) in the [[2002 FIFA World Cup knockout stage#South Korea vs Italy|round of 16]].

